# Me7: time-averaged g(r) for MEAM-Si — frozen LAMMPS reference (CI is LAMMPS-free).
# 216-atom diamond Si (3×3×3), equilibrated 600 K NVT, then NVE-averaged g(r) over the MEAM cutoff.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice diamond 5.431
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 28.0855
pair_style meam
pair_coeff * * library.meam Si Si.meam Si
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes
fix 1 all nvt temp 600 600 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 3000
unfix 1
reset_timestep 0
fix 2 all nve
compute myrdf all rdf 80 1 1
fix 3 all ave/time 5 200 1000 c_myrdf[*] file meam_rdf_lammps.gr mode vector
run 1000
write_data meam_rdf_216.data nocoeff
